{
  "openrpc": "1.3.2",
  "info": {
    "title": "agents-control",
    "version": "0",
    "description": "The methods the control plane answers itself, with no `h`. Every method's params are its one `params` value, sent as JSON-RPC's whole params (an object, or for a few a bare value), as DaemonAPI sends them. A method with `x-notification` has no result: the server sends it. The `web` tag marks what the web page calls and hears (DaemonAPI.WebSignatures); a method a Go step ports joins with its types, schema first."
  },
